   "editor": "<p>She said <span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qc\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">my <b>mother</b> and <i>aunt</i> help me</span> every day.</p><p><span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qc\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">   </span></p><p><span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qh\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">I   just\n\n  keep\tgoing&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qe\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">घर में <span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qf\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">\"topper\" बनो</span> कहते हैं</span></p><p><span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qi\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\">Fees are **too** high</span></p><p><span class=\"qual-tag\" data-qcode=\"qg\" title=\"t\" style=\"background:#f59e0b55\"><br></span></p>",
